1
00:00:00,377 --> 00:00:04,217
(Santa:)Santa thinks dating you
may be punishment enough.

2
00:00:07,451 --> 00:00:09,451
(Sheldon:)There's an argument
for that.

3
00:00:09,453 --> 00:00:11,383
(Sheldon:)But I want to make sure.

4
00:00:11,388 --> 00:00:12,118
(Photographer:)Smile.

5
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:13,622
Ho, ho, ho!

6
00:00:19,362 --> 00:00:22,132
(Leonard:)Okay. On the
count of three,

7
00:00:22,132 --> 00:00:24,502
(Leonard:)I'll shoot the fire extinguisher
and get him airborne.

8
00:00:24,501 --> 00:00:26,831
(Leonard:)Howard, you wave the blanket
and guide him towards the exit.

9
00:00:26,837 --> 00:00:28,867
(Leonard:)Raj, you hold open the
curtain so he can fly out.

10
00:00:28,872 --> 00:00:31,302
(Howard:)Are you sure a dummy
like me can handle something

11
00:00:31,308 --> 00:00:33,338
(Howard:)as complicated
as a blanket?

12
00:00:33,343 --> 00:00:35,543
(Leonard:)Do you want the
fire extinguisher?

13
00:00:35,545 --> 00:00:37,315
(Howard:)Yeah, I do.
Great.

14
00:00:37,314 --> 00:00:38,314
(Leonard:)Here you go.

15
00:00:38,315 --> 00:00:40,345
(Leonard:)Okay.

16
00:00:42,719 --> 00:00:45,389
(Howard:)One, two, three.

17
00:00:48,925 --> 00:00:50,395
(Raj:)Uh, you have to
take the pin out.

18
00:00:54,631 --> 00:00:57,201
(Leonard:)You miss the blanket now,
don't you?

19
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:01,200
(Howard:)On three.

